# Standarisasi Line Endings & Git Attributes
# Mencegah whitespace churn dan inkonsistensi CRLF vs LF lintas sistem operasi

* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
